{"title": "Bind Pact Weapon", "pageid": 14021, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bind_Pact_Weapon", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Hexed_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\">Bind Hexed Weapon</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bind_Pact_Weapon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bind_Pact_Weapon.webp/300px-Bind_Pact_Weapon.webp, /w/images/c/c9/Bind_Pact_Weapon.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bind_Pact_Weapon.webp/300px-Bind_Pact_Weapon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bind_Pact_Weapon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Bind Pact Weapon</b> is a class action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">warlocks</a> that choose <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Pact of the Blade (passive feature)\">Pact of the Blade</a> at level 3. This is for binding existing weapons - to summon a new weapon, use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\">Pact of the Blade</a></span>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Bind to your main hand weapon. Its damage becomes magical, you cannot drop or throw it, and you become <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with it if you weren't already. \n</p><p>You can only have 1 pact weapon at any time and it uses your <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifier.\n</p>\nThe weapon returns to its previous state if you are more than 1.5 m (5 ft) away from it for more than 10 rounds.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_PactOfTheBlade_Bind</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_PactOfTheBlade_Bind\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_PactOfTheBlade_Bind\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Pact_Weapon\"> Condition: Pact Weapon </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Pact Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Pact Weapon (Condition)\">Pact Weapon</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The warlock bound to this weapon is always <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficient</a> with it. The weapon's damage is magical.</li>\n<li>The weapon uses the caster's <a href=\"/wiki/Abilities#Ability_score_modifiers\" title=\"Abilities\">Charisma modifier</a> for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and damage rolls.</li>\n<li>Prevents the weapon from being dropped or otherwise disarmed.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite the extra description, no code exists in the game that removes Pact Weapon from a weapon that is away from the Warlock.</li>\n<li>The Pact Weapon condition only get removed on respec if the weapon was equipped. Leaving the weapon in inventory wont remove it.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034525\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2303/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29066/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13004/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1084094/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n102.60%   59.409     26 Template:Trim\n100.00%   57.902      1 -total\n 98.57%   57.074      1 Template:Feature_page\n 21.03%   12.179      1 Template:MdSAI\n 17.30%   10.016      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 13.72%    7.946      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.58%    6.705      1 Template:Condition\n 11.4